      "writtenOn": "2019-01-25T07:55:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "2-3 hours seems like reasonable upper limit.  But I guess 1 hour works too.\n(2-ish because I think I\u0027ve seen firewalls with 2 hour timeouts - perhaps linux default?)\n\nMinimum should perhaps be all the way down to 5s? Certainly not any lower.  I guess 10s works too... Probably does need to be \u003c15s due to existence of such timeouts in firewalls I\u0027m aware of (for UDP).\n\nTimeouts could also be per-protocol?  But not sure if that\u0027s worth the bother.\n\nIf I had to choose something, I\u0027d perhaps go with 8s..3h or 12s..2h.  Depending on how aggressive we want to be.",
